@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Fee roster
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/fees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Fee roster filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/fees?feePaid=false&retreatGroupId={{retreatGroupId}}&keyword=Grace
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Fee detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/fees/{{participantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Fee events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/fees/{{participantId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Mark fee paid
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/fees/{{participantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "feePaid": true,
  "reason": "Confirmed by treasurer"
}

### Revert fee to unpaid
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/fees/{{participantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "feePaid": false,
  "reason": "Marked paid by mistake"
}
